---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="What labs.kovir.org collects: no cookies or analytics; the contact form only.">
  <section class="section container prose-page">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="lede">This site has no cookies, no analytics, and no third-party scripts. It loads nothing from other servers.</p>

    <h2>The contact form</h2>
    <p>
      When you send the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>, it collects your name, email address,
      organization if you give one, and your message. The form is processed and stored by our host, <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/">Netlify</a>, which checks it for spam using Akismet, and it is emailed to the Kovir team.
    </p>
    <p>
      We use what you send only to reply to you. If you tick "OK to post this idea publicly", we may also
      post your idea on the community forum, without your name, email or organization. We never sell or share
      your details.
    </p>

    <h2>The community forum</h2>
    <p>
      The <a href="https://github.com/kovirlabs/community/discussions">community forum</a> is hosted on
      GitHub. Anything you post there is public and covered by GitHub's <a href="https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">privacy statement</a>.
      This site shows forum titles and vote counts, copied once a day.
    </p>

    <h2>More detail</h2>
    <p>
      Kovir Labs is part of Kovir LLC. The <a href="https://www.kovir.org/privacy">Kovir LLC privacy policy</a>
      covers your rights and how to contact us about your data. You can also email <a href="mailto:info@kovir.org">info@kovir.org</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose-page { max-width: 46rem; }
  .prose-page h2 { margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
